# Cloudflare Pages routing. The ONLY job here is to stop the site
# serving the repository it is built from.
#
# `wrangler.jsonc` points the asset directory at `.`, so Pages uploads
# the repo root and serves every file in it. Measured on 2026-09-05
# against production: `/handover.md` returned 200 with the real position
# history, `/supabase/migrations/0033_*.sql` returned the actual purchase
# records, and `/src/*`, `/supabase/*`, `/CLAUDE.md` and `/.env.example`
# were readable by anyone. `.assetsignore` was tried first and is ignored
# by this project — the platform served that file too.
#
# Rules are `from  to  status`, evaluated top to bottom, one splat each.

/handover.md            /   404
/LEDGER.md              /   404
/CLAUDE.md              /   404
/AGENTS.md              /   404
/README.md              /   404
/SECURITY.md            /   404
/.assetsignore          /   404
/.env.example           /   404
/package.json           /   404
/package-lock.json      /   404
/wrangler.jsonc         /   404
/knip.json              /   404
/deno.lock              /   404
/eslint.config.js       /   404
/.size-limit.json       /   404
/src/*                  /   404
/supabase/*             /   404
/scraps/*               /   404
/hooks/*                /   404
/.ledger/*              /   404
/.claude/*              /   404
/.cursor/*              /   404
/.agents/*              /   404
/.github/*              /   404
/public/*               /   404
